WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
You said you'd stop at eleven.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.200
It's one forty.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.500
You didn't plan to stay up.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600
Nothing told you to stop.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.300
So we made something that does.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.800
ShutCap.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.900
Pick the time your PC turns off each night.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.600
It warns you forty-five minutes before.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.200
Then twenty-five.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.600
Then it counts you down.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.300
At zero, Windows gives your apps a minute to close,

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.400
and the PC shuts down.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.000
A real emergency?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.700
Write why, and tonight is cancelled.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.500
ShutCap keeps a note of it.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.300
It never locks you out.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.000
It turns off once a night, and that's it.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.800
No account. No tracking.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.500
ShutCap.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.200
Stop on time.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.500
Free for Windows.
